     buttons in the full-height sidebar instead (see activity_parametric_eq.xml's
     workspace_settings_button/workspace_more_button and
     DspWorkspaceActivity.onContentChanged()). The "more" submenu's items moved to
     menu_dsp_workspace_more.xml, inflated into a PopupMenu from that button. Power stays here,
     it's still a Toolbar action icon. -->
